/**
 * Samhälle & institutioner → Politik & demokrati → Politiska idéer, 1351–1357 (0.30): liberalism,
 * conservatism, socialism, nationalism, feminism, green ideology, and compromise and reform.
 * Ideologies are shown through what they care about (the free individual, the old house worth keeping,
 * shared coins, the flag, the balanced scale, the leaf, the handshake), never through real parties,
 * real flags other than the Swedish one, or symbols of a particular movement. No text names a word.
 */
